1
00:00:00,895 --> 00:00:02,619
As Uke comes to grab your wrist

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:07,099
slide in slightly to his rear 
leading Uke around in a big circular movement,

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,147
cut down

4
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:10,304
as Uke tries to regain his balance,

5
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:12,746
turn again slightly controlling his hand and wrist,

6
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:14,059
place it against your chest

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,812
compress the joint down 
so Uke´s balance comes forward in front of you.

8
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:20,485
Turn Uke´s body over controlling his elbow,

9
00:00:20,486 --> 00:00:22,112
bringing the other knee around

10
00:00:22,113 --> 00:00:24,778
supporting him 
so his shoulder is been between your knees

11
00:00:24,779 --> 00:00:26,284
hold him tight against your body

12
00:00:26,285 --> 00:00:28,232
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

